<title>GERMANY: Apple CEO sees profit from fiscal Q2.</title>
<headline>Apple CEO sees profit from fiscal Q2.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The head of Apple Computer Inc, Gilbert Amelio, told reporters on Wednesday that he expected the company to return to profitability beginning in the second quarter of its fiscal year, which begins in October.</p>
<p>He said the company had cut costs by $140 million since he took charge seven months ago. Liquidity was now between $1.3 billion and $1.4 billion.</p>
<p>Amelio was speaking at a news conference at the company's German subsidiary in Munich.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097-150</p>
</text>
